# Secret scanning ignore patterns for audit-hub
# Consumed by scripts/secret-scan.js (one pattern per line, `#` starts a comment).
# Wildcards `*` and `?` are supported and are matched against the full path and the file name.
#
# Only documentation and example material is ignored here. Demo/test/fixture files are
# still scanned; placeholder values (for example `YOUR_API_KEY_HERE`) are filtered by the
# scanner's placeholder detection instead of by path.

docs/
documentation/
playground/
samples/
examples/
demo/

# Demo/private-key examples that ship with documentation
*playground*.html
*playground*.md
*demo*.html
*demo*.md
